.source{content="# LIN-PURE-001 independent validation\n\nTimestamp: 2026-08-29T02:19:12.163Z; revision: e46c0403; device: AMD Radeon RX 6600 (radeonsi, navi23, ACO, DRM 3.64, 7.1.8-1-cachyos); driver: 26.1.6-arch3.1.\n\nGates: PURE PASS; SIMD NOT_OBSERVED (assembly contained scalar imulq, no vector instruction); PARALLEL PASS (dependency proof); GPU PASS (exact comparison, mismatches=0); GPU speedup: GPU_SPEEDUP_NOT_OBSERVED.\n\nAll timings are microseconds, 20 repetitions; GPU end-to-end includes H2D + kernel + D2H.\n\n1024:cpu: mean=1.223us median=0.769us min=0.574us max=3.118us p95=2.271us variance=0.549us² stddev=0.741us\n1024:llvm: mean=4.930us median=2.822us min=2.271us max=14.554us p95=13.394us variance=18.491us² stddev=4.300us\n1024:h2d: mean=166.195us median=119.642us min=106.178us max=1071.856us p95=143.489us variance=43249.045us² stddev=207.964us\n1024:kernel: mean=12.052us median=12.360us min=11.120us max=14.920us p95=12.560us variance=0.752us² stddev=0.867us\n1024:d2h: mean=270.491us median=201.353us min=189.189us max=1489.157us p95=247.315us variance=78380.449us² stddev=279.965us\n1024:gpu_e2e: mean=448.738us median=333.808us min=314.796us max=2575.933us p95=367.817us variance=238389.973us² stddev=488.252us\n16384:cpu: mean=18.086us median=12.634us min=11.278us max=71.819us p95=29.526us variance=181.954us² stddev=13.489us\n16384:llvm: mean=39.013us median=34.426us min=32.349us max=95.640us p95=42.886us variance=177.610us² stddev=13.327us\n16384:h2d: mean=176.140us median=142.656us min=130.612us max=821.889us p95=165.928us variance=22005.203us² stddev=148.342us\n16384:kernel: mean=19.854us median=20.000us min=16.280us max=20.800us p95=20.800us variance=0.926us² stddev=0.962us\n16384:d2h: mean=257.114us median=239.066us min=219.879us max=582.992us p95=308.845us variance=5903.998us² stddev=76.837us\n16384:gpu_e2e: mean=453.108us median=400.802us min=366.771us max=1424.481us p95=462.386us variance=49960.452us² stddev=223.518us\n65536:cpu: mean=63.084us me